	"Text": "Almighty and merciful God, [t] do not let our earthly efforts hinder us on our journey to meet Your Son. [*] Instead, draw us onward with heavenly wisdom and instruction. Prepare our hearts to see Jesus, to welcome Him, and allow us to accept His invitation to share life with Him",
